From: EmpiierOS Trusted Substrate
Subject: [PATCH] WebRTC: set DTLS PEM on webrtcbin before SDP

GStreamer 1.24 webrtcbin has no certificates property. WebKit left
RTCConfiguration certificates as a FIXME and generateCertificate
fingerprints empty. JVB then sees ICE without DTLS
("No remote fingerprints"). Generate ECDSA P-256 PEM, set it on
dtlssrtpdec / DTLS transports before READY/SDP, and fill sha-256
fingerprints. Pin stays 2.52.6.

