 Source/WebCore/Modules/mediastream/gstreamer/GStreamerMediaEndpoint.h   |   6 +
 Source/WebCore/Modules/mediastream/gstreamer/GStreamerWebRTCUtils.cpp   |  18 +-
 3 files changed, 140 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

